# Secrets — never commit. These are needed in the build context to deploy, but are
# supplied out-of-band (kept on disk locally / as CI secrets), NOT tracked in git.
#
#   pf.jwk                       PF master key — decrypts every secret in data.zip
#   pingfederate-system-keys.xml PF system keys
#   pingfederate.lic             PingFederate evaluation license (expires 2026-07-13)
#
# data.zip itself IS committed: it is a PF config-archive encrypted WITH pf.jwk, so
# without the master key it cannot be decrypted — safe to version. The master key is
# what must stay out of git.
overlay/pf.jwk
overlay/pingfederate-system-keys.xml
pingfederate.lic

# PingOne MFA Integration Kit (licensed, gated download; supplied to the build out-of-band)
pf-pingone-mfa-integration-kit-*.zip
